The SLC631 Lighting Relay could be embedded in any global standard in-wall junction box, connecting the traditional switch panel without destroying the original home decoration style. It could remotely control the in-wall switch when it works with a gateway.

## Key Features

- ZigBee HA1.2 compliant, works with any standard ZHA ZigBee hub
- Upgrades existing lighting to a remote control lighting system
- Optional 1-3 channels
- Remote control, schedules, linkage (on/off) and scene support (max. 16 scenes)
- Compatible with heating, ventilation and LED drivers for on/off control
- Outside leads for control
